> </div></div> <h1>Stran ne obstaja!</h1> <p>Iskane strani ni bilo mogoče najti!</p> <div class="buttons clearfix"> <div class="pull-right"><a href="https://www.superink.si/" class="btn btn-primary">Nadaljuj</a></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="cart-confirm" class="modal fade" role="dialog"> <div class="modal-dialog"> <div class="modal-content"> <div class="modal-header"> <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button> <h4 class="modal-title">Košarica</h4> </div> <div class="modal-body"> <p style="margin:20px;"><span id="cart-text"></span></p> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">Nadaljujte z nakupovanjem</button> <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onClick="location.href='https://www.superink.si/index.php?route=checkout/checkout'">Na blagajno</button> </div> </div> </div> </div> <style> footer { margin-top: 0 !important; background: #111 !important; border-top: none !important; padding: 0 !important; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; } #si-footer-main { padding: 40px 0 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); } #si-footer-main .container { max-width: 1200px; } .si-footer-brand { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin-bottom: 8px; } .si-footer-desc { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 300; } .si-footer-contact { margin-top: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; } .si-footer-contact a { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; } .si-footer-contact a:hover { color: #fff; } footer h5 { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif !important; font-size: 10px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; color: #fff !important; letter-spacing: 2px !important; text-transform: uppercase !important; margin-bottom: 16px !important; margin-top: 0 !important; } footer ul.list-unstyled li { margin-bottom: 8px; } footer ul.list-unstyled li a { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45) !important; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.15s; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; } footer ul.list-unstyled li a:hover { color: #fff !important; } #si-footer-bottom { background: #0A0A0A; padding: 14px 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.3px; } #si-footer-bottom a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); } #si-footer-bottom a:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); } footer hr { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.07) !important; } </style> <footer> <div id="si-footer-main"> <div class="container"> <div class="row"> <!-- BRAND COL --> <div class="col-sm-4"> <div class="si-footer-brand">Superink</div> <div class="si-footer-desc">Vaša zaupanja vredna rešitev<br>za prodajo, najem in servis<br>tiskalnikov po vsej Sloveniji.</div> <div class="si-footer-contact"> <a href="https://www.superink.si/index.php?route=information/contact"><i class="fa fa-phone" style="width:14px;color:#C0392B;"></i> 0590 95 484</a> <a href="mailto:info@superink.si"><i class="fa fa-envelope" style="width:14px;color:#C0392B;"></i> info@superink.si</a> <a href="https://www.superink.si/index.php?route=information/contact"><i class="fa fa-map-marker" style="width:14px;color:#C0392B;"></i> Ljubljana, Slovenija</a> </div> </div> <!-- INFO COL --> <!-- SERVICE COL --> <div class="col-sm-2"> <h5>Storitve za stranke</h5> <ul class="list-unstyled"> <li><a href="https://www.superink.si/index.php?route=information/contact">Kontakt</a></li> <li><a href="https://www.superink.si/index.php?route=account/return/add">Vračila</a></li> <li><a href="https://www.superink.si/index.php?route=information/sitemap">Mapa strani</a></li> </ul> </div> <!-- EXTRA COL --> <div class="col-sm-2"> <h5>Storitve</h5> <ul class="list-unstyled"> <li><a href="#">Prodaja tiskalnikov</a></li> <li><a href="#">Najem tiskalnikov</a></li> <li><a href="#">Ser